  {q:"Professional development regarding AI in counseling should include:",a:["Only technical training","Understanding ethical implications, limitations, bias, and appropriate clinical applications","Learning to code AI systems","Marketing AI to clients"],c:1,e:"Counselors need education on ethical, clinical, and practical dimensions of AI in mental health."}
